    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51827" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθῐκετεύω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span></b> , strengthd. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκετεύω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>entreat earnestly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατικ. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.68
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ κ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					6.14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span> c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat. Mi.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Parth.
				5.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.384
			</span></i>:—also in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				324
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
